{"availability":"available","full":"ayushYadav1107/Eco_Loop","name":"Eco_Loop","description":"Autonomous closed-loop HVAC control: a live EnergyPlus simulation supervised by a local open-source LLM over the Model Context Protocol. Setpoints are injected into the running solver - no IDF rewrite, no restart. 8.5% HVAC energy saved while holding thermal comfort. Demo: https://www.loom.com/share/cd6b6eea292747a3bbe7087e8b16ab78","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-25T13:47:42Z","updated":"2026-07-26T17:29:02Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://eco-loop-agents.streamlit.app/","topics":["agentic-ai","building-automation","building-energy","digital-twin","energyplus","hvac","llama","llm","mcp","model-context-protocol","ollama","python","simulation","streamlit","thermal-comfort"],"demo":"https://www.loom.com/share/cd6b6eea292747a3bbe7087e8b16ab78","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T05:25:18.432Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-20T05:25:18.432Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-20T05:25:18.432Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:44:40.741Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T07:32:39.637Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:26:40.928Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:50:11.162Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-20T05:25:18.432Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A building that runs itself. EnergyPlus supplies the physics, a local open-source LLM supplies the judgement, and the Model Context Protocol carries every reading and every command between them — while the simulation is still running.","▶ Watch the demo · Live dashboard · Architecture","Traditional building management systems follow rigid clock schedules. Eco-Loop turns the building into a self-correcting agent: sensors are read every zone timestep, the aggregated state goes to the LLM through six MCP tools once per control interval, and the validated se